{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20114","headline":"送超上人归天台 · 孟郊","name":"送超上人归天台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天台山最高，动蹑赤城霞。\n何以静双目，扫山除妄花。\n何以洁其性，滤泉去泥沙。\n灵境物皆直，万松无一斜。\n月中见心近，云外将俗赊。\n山兽护方丈，山猿捧袈裟。\n遗身独得身，笑我牵名华。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20114.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20114","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}